config EXAMPLE_FOO
	tristate "Example Foo Driver"
	help
	  This is an example foo driver that demonstrates Kleaf DDK capabilities.
	  It shows how to structure a driver, export APIs, and integrate
	  Device Tree bindings.

	  If unsure, say N.

config EXAMPLE_BAR
	tristate "Example Bar Driver"
	help
	  This is an example bar driver that depends on the foo driver.
	  It demonstrates inter-module dependencies and how to handle
	  optional dependencies using inline stubs when foo is disabled.

	  If unsure, say N.
